[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6182.87, "timestamp": "01:43:02", "text": "呃，下午 6 點，我會切換到第二部分直播，屆時我們將與 Davis 的兒子合作，呃，凌晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6186.79, "timestamp": "01:43:06", "text": "2 點，我們還有 Avisan 先生。我們將與 Avis 樂團合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6189.59, "timestamp": "01:43:09", "text": "呃，我們將和 Avisan 一起玩 Reaper，為 Davisan 而戰。我還沒確定具體"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6192.63, "timestamp": "01:43:12", "text": "遊戲內容，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6196.469, "timestamp": "01:43:16", "text": "我們可能會畫畫或塗鴉，或是搞一些藝術直播之類的活動。就是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6205.75, "timestamp": "01:43:25", "text": "接下來，我們的下一位嘉賓是 Tatamsa，我們將介紹 Muk 和 Josan。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6208.15, "timestamp": "01:43:28", "text": "我還沒確定要玩什麼遊戲，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6211.349, "timestamp": "01:43:31", "text": "我想我們會玩點什麼，可能是《Valerant》或其他音樂之類的。嗨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6222.87, "timestamp": "01:43:42", "text": "，嗯……嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6232.95, "timestamp": "01:43:52", "text": "我想他們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6238.309, "timestamp": "01:43:58", "text": "之後應該就沒事了。"}]